## 0. How to read this part

Everything built so far stays as it is: the home page, the scene, the hero, the footer, the tokens and the standards in `docs/ENGINEERING.md`. This part adds pages in the same visual language (glass surfaces, Inter Tight light headlines with serif-italic accents, periwinkle accent `#8d94ff`, the violet and night backdrop with the crystal koi). Reuse the existing components (`Button`/link styles, `RichText`, `StepsStrip`, `CtaPanel`, `SiteFooter`, glass surface, chips, icons, `useReveal`). Do not copy their code; import them. Work in this order: (a) plan in `docs/plan-3.md`; (b) implement; (c) check section 9 and record pass/fail in `docs/verification-3.md`.

## 1. Scope

1. Navigation dropdowns (desktop) and a full-screen drawer (phone layout, 820px and below).
2. Scene behaviour on pages that have no hero.
3. The shared page layout and a data-driven `ContentPage` template for 11 pages.
4. Documentation page, Privacy page, Terms page (static content).

Not in this part: Contact, Book a call, Get started, Login, Opt out, Customer stories, Partner directory, System status. They stay as `PageStub` until Part 4, which builds them with the database and forms.

