| `AccessRequest` | `full_name`*, `email`*, `company`*, `interest`* (curation / monetization / forecasts / other), `message`, `consent_given`*, `consent_at`*, `status`, `request_id`*, `source_path` |
| `ContactMessage` | `full_name`*, `email`*, `topic`* (general / partnership / support), `message`*, `consent_given`*, `consent_at`*, `status`, `request_id`*, `source_path` |
